spell.new-old-spells-plus.oh3Fear.descri:
{Advanced Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear, that it becomes unable to attack and nearly unable to move.

Penalty to movement is twice that of Basic Fear (-50% speed).

{Expert Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear, that it becomes unable to attack and nearly unable to move.

Penalty to movement is three times that of Basic Fear (-75% speed).
